  <content>
    <description>The Ellen MacArthur Foundation is a charitable organization focused on the
      development and promotion of the circular economy. They support and collaborate with business,
      academia, policymakers, and institutions around the world. They create resources,
      publications, and tools that assist policymakers establish effective policies for enabling a
      circular economy. They focus on work areas that can make the biggest impact, including
      plastics, food, fashion, finance, and cities.</description>
